{"name":"Phuket Palette","hex":"#0480bd","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"palette","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A thin board on which a painter lays and mixes colours.","A set of colours available to be used (or mixed)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/palette"}],"entries":[{"title":"Phuket province","blocks":[{"text":"Phuket is one of the southern provinces (changwat) of Thailand. It consists of the island of Phuket, the country's largest island, and another 32 smaller islands off its coast. Phuket lies off the west coast of mainland Thailand in the Andaman Sea. Phuket Island is connected by the Sarasin Bridge to Phang Nga province to the north. The next nearest province is Krabi, to the east across Phang Nga Bay."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Phuket_Aerial.jpg/330px-Phuket_Aerial.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phuket_province","wikidata":"Q182565"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Audience_with_Narai%2C_1685-10-18_%28b%29.jpg/500px-Audience_with_Narai%2C_1685-10-18_%28b%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Audience_with_Narai%2C_1685-10-18_%28b%29.jpg/1280px-Audience_with_Narai%2C_1685-10-18_%28b%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Audience_with_Narai%2C_1685-10-18_%28b%29.jpg/500px-Audience_with_Narai%2C_1685-10-18_%28b%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"French ambassador Chevalier de Chaumont with King Narai","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAudience_with_Narai%2C_1685-10-18_(b).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/%D0%94%D0%BE%D0%BC_%D1%81